              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah gideaba mwahida gideaba gayghamwas ASEETA, ghwanung'waada ASEETA gwasin searoojiga munyas gasa fugheerga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyiit jeesinga nyaawa ng'asheega sean munyas, munyinda, ea shidoodeaba ghaang'; geawunda gheang'da. Lajoodeaba ghuut, ea nuusta buuneeda, ea jaleadinga, ea reengaweega, sicheeda, fuga aga badahuukeaba geat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "napiisa geat ng'uyeega, fuga biissa ghwasit ASEETA, bea ghwarja, fuga manda gidamwanang', bea ghwarjeeda, fuga iissa gwasin ng'asheega munyas, masissiina ghweaniga nyaawa mureeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fuga dasheahi, mandeawana masaweega, biissa ng'weani jeesin, fuga mabayiida suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.1.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 1:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi nal muuchi diigheanda ASEETA nea fuga sina ng'asheesu gammiisa miyeeda, ea meakghusa gideaba gwasin ng'asheesu, iissa ghamwas eara fuga sina ng'asheesu.",
          "type": "text",
